    <title>E17 想向父母橱柜，但不想把父母锁在柜子里</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6643ac9b251bd96e6c572de4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6643ac9b251bd96e6c572de4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>前言 😄 介绍</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎打开「摸鱼撸猫」，我是辰之。</span></p><span></span><p><span>首先我是直男，其次这期邀请了两位已经橱柜的朋友，向我科普了关于另一种性别的知识，有关信仰，有关爱，有关家人，有关成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>收听 🎧 提示</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 什么时候发现自己喜欢男生？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 🌈第一关：直男关</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a> 🌈第二关：橱柜关</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 🌈第三关：敌视关</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a> 去病化比合法化更重要</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a> 🌈的“mbti”标签划分</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2815">46:55</a> 🌈会喜欢直男吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">51:25</a> 🌈的特殊能力：一眼能找到同类</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3471">57:51</a> 🌈的最难关：如何向父母橱柜？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5391">89:51</a> 对未来的期待和对爱情的看法</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾 🌹 林道一</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>10年通讯录小软件经验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>曾任厦门🌈酒吧服务员</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🌈剧本杀店消费爱好者</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>肩上的脚丫吧/505美分吧元老</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>去过北上深南杭西长武成重秦等多地同志娱乐场所</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾 🌹 是小钿钿</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>社群创始人，自由职业</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>初出茅庐刚到成都半年的潮汕猎熊仔🐻</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>座右铭：作为人，何谓正确</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>创作 ✏️ 人员</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主播：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：林道一 &amp; 是小钿钿</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>文稿：暂无</span></p><span></span><h2><span>关于「摸鱼撸猫」🐱🐟</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《摸鱼撸猫》每期邀请一位朋友聊个天，顾名思义是个不垂直的轻松聊天播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原则上不会为难嘉宾，拒绝嘉宾表演，但不拒绝嘉宾硬要表演。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>联系 📱 方式</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主理人：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：辰之同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>两只喵(全网同名)：杨狗好烧</span></p><span></span><p><span>读书&amp;播客分享群+v：gzccc1996</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你收听愉快！！！</span></p>]]></description>
