    <title>E16 相信科学：关于本命年、犯太岁，其实是一件好事？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/659aa7c2ed29175cc313c6d7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">659aa7c2ed29175cc313c6d7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jan 2024 13:31:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>前言 😄 介绍</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎打开「摸鱼撸猫」，我是辰之。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每到新旧年交替，身边会有很多朋友说自己本命年、犯太岁，对此邀请到一位对传统文化研究颇深的好朋友——云谷道长，聊聊这个话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾 🌹 云谷仙踪</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>正乙派散居道士，植物爱好者</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>诗号：云谷常空，仙迹无踪</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>收听 🎧 提示</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 本命年不是十二年一轮回？它是怎么规定的？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 太岁的由来，太岁有几种？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 传统文化所说的“犯太岁”又是什么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1199">19:59</a> 哪些属相会犯冲，属相不和是怎么规定的？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a> 万一犯太岁有什么解决办法吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a> 老道建议养生的几个原则</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 好吃好喝好睡，少思寡欲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 科学是追求道的一种方式</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>创作 ✏️ 人员</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主播：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：云谷仙踪</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>文稿：暂无</span></p><span></span><h2><span>关于「摸鱼撸猫」🐱🐟</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《摸鱼撸猫》每期邀请一位朋友聊个天，顾名思义是个不垂直的轻松聊天播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原则上不会为难嘉宾，拒绝嘉宾表演，但不拒绝嘉宾硬要表演。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>联系 📱 方式</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主理人：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：辰之同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>两只喵(全网同名)：杨狗好烧</span></p><span></span><p><span>读书&amp;播客分享群+v：gzccc1996</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你收听愉快！！！</span></p>]]></description>
