    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Sep 2023 22:58:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>前言 😄 介绍</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎打开「摸鱼嗦猫」，我是辰之。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目的第十五期，本来是和朋友喝下午茶，突然觉得聊的内容可以做成播客，赶回酒店录了这期。星星在大学期间玩自媒体月入过万，毕业就买房，现在在南昌创业自媒体。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾 🌹 星星</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>创业自媒体人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>收听 🎧 提示</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 靠《甄嬛传》赚到第一桶金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 一个人组建自媒体团队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">12:22</a> 为什么大学选择写图文赚钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 现在还能靠写图文赚钱吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 赚到第一桶金飘了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 拍视频的失败教训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 第一次创业的失败教训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2227">37:07</a> 恋人分手亲人病重寻找自我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> 操盘手不是核心竞争力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2772">46:12</a> 过往的成功限制住了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2956">49:16</a> 分享欲是内容人最重要的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3372">56:12</a> 因上努力，果上随缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3503">58:23</a> 如何让女生追自己</span></p><span></span><h2><span>创作 ✏️ 人员</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主播：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：星星</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>文稿：暂无</span></p><span></span><h2><span>关于「摸鱼撸猫」🐱🐟</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《摸鱼撸猫》每期邀请一位朋友聊个天，顾名思义是个不垂直的轻松聊天播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原则上不会为难嘉宾，拒绝嘉宾表演，但不拒绝嘉宾硬要表演。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>联系 📱 方式</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主理人：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：辰之同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>两只喵(全网同名)：杨狗好烧</span></p><span></span><p><span>读书&amp;播客分享群+v：gzccc1996</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你收听愉快！！！</span></p>]]></description>
