    <guid isPermaLink="false">648893fd6752b5f9deaa09cd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>前言 😄 介绍</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎打开「摸鱼撸猫」，我是辰之。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目的第十四期，邀请到了一对情侣，女生保险经理，男生程序员，但俩人合伙创业做着上海家政业务和一个相亲业务。录制前得知两位快结婚了，封面是结婚照，祝两位新人今后日子顺顺利利！红红火火！</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾 🌹 海伦&amp;柯南 &nbsp;(couple)</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>海伦：相亲群群主&amp;上海家政项目合伙人&amp;保险经理</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>柯南：程序员届的一股清流&amp;上海家政项目创始人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>收听 🎧 提示</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 半年做了200多个上海家政群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a> 新手怎样从零到一做家政行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a> 怎样设计一个家政产品/服务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 想做保洁阿姨需要什么样的条件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 旅游相识的灵魂伴侣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2716">45:16</a> 我在上海无偿做红娘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 划重点——怎样提高相亲成功概率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3668">61:08</a> 男女相亲的不同需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3849">64:09</a> 在一起长久的秘诀就是心甘情愿帮对方解决问题</span></p><span></span><h2><span>创作 ✏️ 人员</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主播：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：海伦 &amp; 柯南</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>文稿：暂无</span></p><span></span><h2><span>关于「摸鱼撸猫」🐱🐟</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《摸鱼撸猫》每期邀请一位朋友聊个天，顾名思义是个不垂直的轻松聊天播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原则上不会为难嘉宾，拒绝嘉宾表演，但不拒绝嘉宾硬要表演。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>联系 📱 方式</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主理人：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：辰之同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>两只喵(全网同名)：杨狗好烧</span></p><span></span><p><span>读书&amp;播客分享群+v：gzccc1996</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你收听愉快！！！</span></p>]]></description>
