    <title>E03 这个春天，上海疫情改变了我的一生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6296da0c5cf4a5ad60ca1022</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6296da0c5cf4a5ad60ca1022</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Jun 2022 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>前言 😄 介绍</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎打开「摸鱼撸猫」，我是辰之。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是这个节目的第三期，想和同在上海的好朋友蕉皮，一起来聊一下上海疫情下普通人的真实生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>两年前的武汉疫情让我明白，集体记忆是很容易被篡改的，再过几个月我们看到的很多真相都会与记忆相差甚远。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我不想把事情说得那么惨，但我不会相信任何，没有经历过武汉、西安、东北及很多不被关注地区疫情的人说出，「我可以理解你们」这句话。</span></p><span></span><p><span>至少我自己不希望忘记这段记忆，痛苦也不需要诉说，那就好好记录下来，待到每个人生阶段慢慢品尝。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对我来说，这是一份特别宝贵的财富，特别珍贵的修行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想象一下，你和两千五百万人一起被封印在中国经济最发达的城市里，你被隔离在一个固定空间内，断开了所有与外界的物理联系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这时候你面对的，不仅是肉体上的磨砺，还有精神上的洗礼。</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然是被病毒逼迫的，但也是无数人自愿牺牲了自己，只为了更大的集体利益。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们是真正的英雄。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾 🌹 蕉皮</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在一家创业公司做内容</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>商业爱好者，摇滚乐迷</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号：蕉皮碎碎念</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>收听 🎧 提示</span></h2><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;疫情封控在家的状态</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;疫情可能改变了我的一生</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;疫情下是怎么抢菜的</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;远亲不如近邻但也别高估人性</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1752">29:12</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;运力难的真正原因</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">30:46</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;上海团长是一种荣誉</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">34:34</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;会做饭是一个生存技能</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2234">37:14</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;存钱是一个很重要的事</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;不要住酒店式公寓</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2381">39:41</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;一定要买个大冰箱</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">40:42</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;灾难下的社会只接受以物换物</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;烟酒可乐是硬通货</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;人生的每一个幸福错过就永远错过了</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3038">50:38</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;极简生活因为疫情遭受到了严重挑战</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3294">54:54</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;生命遭到威胁一定要大声求救</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3658">60:58</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;疫情封在家为什么还胖了</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3877">64:37</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;未经他人苦莫劝他人善</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4180">69:40</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;享受疫情下的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4503">75:03</a></span></code><span> &nbsp;最后说点正能量</span></p><span></span><h2><span>创作 ✏️ 人员</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主播：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：蕉皮</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>文稿：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WlwwQyn6UnNGw17QP02NMw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WlwwQyn6UnNGw17QP02NMw"><span>《消失的上海春天》</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>关于「摸鱼撸猫」🐱🐟</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《摸鱼撸猫》每期邀请一位朋友聊个天，顾名思义是个不垂直的轻松聊天播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原则上不会为难嘉宾，拒绝嘉宾表演，但不拒绝嘉宾硬要表演。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>联系 📱 方式</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主理人：辰之</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：辰之同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>两只喵(全网同名)：杨狗好烧</span></p><span></span><p><span>读书&amp;播客分享群+v：gzccc1996</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你收听愉快！！！</span></p>]]></description>
